  "content": "[Intro]\n[Db]\n[Gb]  [Ab]\n[Db]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Db]When I get ol der\nlosing my hair\nMany years from now\n[Ab]\nWill you still be sending me a\nvalentine\nBirthday greetings,\n[Db]bottle of wine?\nIf I'd been out till\nquarter to three\n[Db7]Would you lock the door?\n[Gb]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gb]Will you still need [Gbm]me,\n[Db]will you still feed [Bb7]me\n[Eb7]When I'm [Ab]sixtyfour?\n[D]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Bbm]\n[Ab]\n[Bbm]\nYou'll be\nolder\n[F]too\n[Bbm]\nAnd if you\n[Ebm]say the word\n[Gb]I could\n[Ab]stay with\n[Db]you\n[Ab]\n[Ab7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Db]I could be han dy,\nmending a fuse\nWhen your lights have gone\n[Ab]\nYou can knit a sweater by the\nfireside\nSunday mornings\n[Db]go for a ride\nDoing the gar den,\ndigging the weeds\n[Db7]Who could ask for more?\n[Gb]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gb]Will you still need [Gbm]me,\n[Db]will you still feed [Bb7]me\n[Eb7]When I'm [Ab]sixtyfour?\n[Db]\n\n[Bridge]\n[Bbm]Every summer we can rent a\ncottage in the Isle of Wight\n[Ab]If it's not too dear\n[Bbm]\nWe shall\nscrimp and\n[F]save\n[Bbm]\nGrandchildren\n[Ebm]on your knee\n[Gb]Vera,\n[Ab]Chuck and\n[Db]Dave\n[Ab]\n[Ab7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Db]Send me a post card,\ndrop me a line\nStating point of view\n[Ab]\nIndicate precisely what you\nmean to say\nYours sincerely,\n[Db]wasting away\nGive me your ans wer,\nfill in a form\n[Db7]Mine for evermore\n[Gb]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Gb]Will you still need [Gbm]me,\n[Db]will you still feed [Bb7]me\n[Eb7]When I'm [Ab]sixtyfour?\n[Db]Ho!\n\n[Outro]\n[Db]\n[Gb]  [Ab]\n[Db]",
